          "description": {
            "en": "A volume collection of sweet, short and fun 4 pages manga for everyone to enjoy and adore.  \n(All are independent stories, done by various authors. having something cute/sweet making it \"Precious\". They can be read in any order since they aren't related to each other)\n\nChapter List :\n1. Battle of Intelligence [by Kudo Makoto]\n2. The Story of how My Wife was a  Goddess [by Konbu Wakame]\n3. My Tomboy Friend [by Akitaka]\n4. Deep and Distinct [by Ikuhana Niiro]\n5. Hamster Life [by Niichi]\n6. Mimicking Game [by Wakai Ken]\n7. Predation [by Shiro Manta]\n8. Film Club Couple [by Fujichika Koume]\n9. Delinquent & Doctor [by Arita Imari]\n10. Subscience [by Rasupe]\n11. Summer Festival [by Rei]\n12.  Ice Gaze [by Yuzuchiri]\n13. Miss Daydreamer [by Yanagida Fumita]\n14. Absentminded Childhood Friend [by Azuma Fuyu]\n15. GENIUS [by Takaki Tsuyoshi]\n16. Precious bug [by Nakahara Kaihei]\n17. Sibling Play [by Itoyoshi Ryouichi]\n18. Taking The Initiative Against a Deadpan Girlfriend [by Kaze no ko]\n19. Aperitif [by Namori]\n20. Mamimi Always Fails at Teasing! [by Mizu Asato]\n21. Ice cold Hyoudou-san [by Yoneda Kazusa]\n22. Hypnosis [by Oohara Roron]\n23. Wolf is scared of Sheep [by Rucchiifu]\n24. Afro's Love [by Sorato Shunsuke]\n25. Positive Advancement [by Kinoue Seiichi]"
